  "notes": "Preserve the current error-list position, focus and scrollbar when switching between errors and statistics. Restore the saved IR sensor preference when USB exits Settings. Keep generation/IR-hint sensor safety while qualifying navigation-only failures normally; add cached IR failure and accepted-blue LED provenance.\n\nValidation: ten focused host suites plus two production IR suites, fresh independent and motion review, checked build and USB install. The live regression probe preserves focus 2 and 46 px before, during and after Stats; the retained 722 baseline reset to 0. Selected UI QA completed seven routes and three nested pages, with 1,867 zero-output status samples and seven confirmed saved-preference restore events. Frame CRCs, cleanup, BLE/Twin return and flashlight learning were verified.\n\nPrimary IR address-NACK failures, NTC input-zero and cooler low-current observations remain documented; this image does not suppress those faults or claim complete hardware/FPS acceptance. A separate cooler timing experiment follows.\n",
